assembled and ready to go.

00:02:16.340 --> 00:02:17.830
It's crazy how steady this is.

00:02:17.830 --> 00:02:20.580
So it has the two-axis
mechanical gimbal and using AI,

00:02:20.580 --> 00:02:23.660
it can identify other S1s,
it can identify people.

00:02:23.660 --> 00:02:25.890
If you guys are fans of
DJI and their drone line

00:02:25.890 --> 00:02:27.470
then you know that their technology

00:02:27.470 --> 00:02:29.440
and their software, they
integrate so well together.

00:02:29.440 --> 00:02:30.810
There's also one other thing that's not

00:02:30.810 --> 00:02:32.530
out when it's launched.

00:02:32.530 --> 00:02:35.740
Don't roll off the table
'cause you're not on

00:02:35.740 --> 00:02:37.643
and you don't know your name yet.

00:02:39.763 --> 00:02:40.730
Controller.

00:02:40.730 --> 00:02:42.500
There's also these little water pellets.

00:02:42.500 --> 00:02:44.440
So these soak in water
for about four hours

00:02:44.440 --> 00:02:46.270
and then they have like
this little chamber

00:02:46.270 --> 00:02:49.110
that you put these in and
then you load it into the S1.

00:02:49.110 --> 00:02:52.080
Here it is, it's like the
size of a Nintendo Switch.

00:02:52.080 --> 00:02:53.460
Okay, I gotta start
getting this thing together

00:02:53.460 --> 00:02:55.200
because I'm running out of time.

00:02:55.200 --> 00:02:59.743
